Tools: Prometheus, Nagios, Grafana

Use: Tracks infrastructure, application performance, and system health.
Why These Tools?
Legacy tools like Nagios had:
Static configuration files.
Difficulty in handling dynamic environments.
Prometheus introduced:
Real-time metrics collection.
Dynamic service discovery.
Integration with visualization tools like Grafana.
Drawbacks of Legacy Monitoring:
Limited scalability and dynamic support.
Lack of integration with modern cloud-native systems.
